Subject: [PATCH 2/6] local: erssi@tahio branding, tahio theme and a new
 sign-in page

- tahio theme (copper/cream, Geist + Geist Mono hosted locally) set as default
- sign-in: full-screen, live nick!web@host line, keyboard-accessible
  show/hide password, Caps Lock note, clear error, Polish copy
- wordmark erssi@tahio in sidebar and loading screen, new icons/favicons,
  web manifest and page title
